<Positioned left="44" top="1104"><Text fontSize="14" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Hollow marker = the March result, filled marker = now, so the direction of travel is visible without reading numbers.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="44" top="1128"><Text fontSize="14" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">Each track has its own scale, set so that both results and the whole reference range fit.</Text></Positioned>
